SUMMARY:Mindful Recovery
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260314T143000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260314T170000
UID:60a715904cf52a8ced098350@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Our 8-week Mindfulness based Addiction Recovery programme has 
 helped hundreds of people free themselves of unhealthy habits. Whether thi
 s is a cycle of workaholism\, sugar cravings\, or you need a digital break
  but can’t stop checking your phone\; Mindful Recovery will help free yo
 u from unhelpful patterns of behaviour.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindful-recovery-mar-202
 6
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Spring Retreat
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260403T193000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260403T130000
UID:0d350ac75a465387497ca3fc@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Come on retreat at this time of blossoming and renewal\, and g
 et in touch with value and meaning. We’ll be creating the best possible 
 conditions in which to practise meditation and Buddhism so we can grow tow
 ards our full potential\, and even touch the sacred. With nine days away f
 rom usual routines in beautiful countryside and experiencing communal livi
 ng\, many have found this retreat life-changing.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/spring-retreat-2026
END:VEVENT
