BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindful Eating:
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260404T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260404T130000
UID:5d0ceaf755d573c28cffcaf5@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a practical and nourishing online workshop explori
 ng what it really means to eat mindfully — to slow down\, pay attention\
 , and experience food through all of our senses. Together we’ll take tim
 e to notice the many sensations involved in hunger\, eating\, and satisfac
 tion\, and explore how mindful awareness can transform the way we relate t
 o food.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindful-eating-2026-04-0
 4
END:VEVENT
